   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Pike County Breakdown (1) (2)**: rare: 6 archived performances [3]\n- **Dust**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **Meet Me @ the Creek**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Here Comes The Sun**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 10 archived performances [3]\n- **CA14 omni**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **ugly battery**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **bs2018-09-06.bs2018-09-06.CA14card.CA920.CA14omni.mix.Tascam.DR_70D** (recommended): source not stated; 21 songs; 132 min [1]\n- **bsc2018-09-06.16bitfac**: source not stated; 20 songs; 121 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Billy Failing had a string break during the show [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **bs2018-09-06.bs2018-09-06.CA14card.CA920.CA14omni.mix.Tascam.DR_70D**: taped by JB; source: source CA14 cards > CA9200 + CA14 omnis > Tascam DR-70D [1]\n- **bsc2018-09-06.16bitfac**: taped by jim malogorski; transferred by jim malogorski; source: dpa 4011c's and Telefunkin m60's (cards and hypers) >788t [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by thecurtainwithblog.blogspot.com: [Billy Strings - 2018-09-06 The Southgate House Revival, Newport, KY](https://thecurtainwithblog.blogspot.com/2019/08/billy-strings-2018-09-06-southgate.html) [4]\n- Fan art by thecurtainwithblog.blogspot.com: [Billy Strings - 2018-09-06 The Southgate House Revival, Newport, KY](https://thecurtainwithblog.blogspot.com/2019/08/billy-strings-2018-09-06-southgate.html) [5]",
